## Speckle

The same CPT data can also be visualized in collaborative AEC platforms. This example shows the ground investigation data integrated with building context, combining data from the 3DBAG, the [3D Basisregistratie Grootschalige Topografie](https://netherlands3d.eu/) (BGT), and a BIM model in a single [Speckle](https://speckle.systems) workspace.

